                        "sense_id": "a8a41b03-22c7-33ea-9842-5354d9f8cd2f",
                        "entry_id": "cc001bed-4fa9-3229-9226-e8e702716171",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a sacred manner."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "16906b6c-16ef-4605-95c5-a07d166e4129",
                                "sense_id": "a8a41b03-22c7-33ea-9842-5354d9f8cd2f",
                                "text": "Scip[io]. […] Remember Syphax / Thy vow hath made thee Romes. / Syph[ax]. Which Ile preserve / As sacredly inviolate, as if / Eternall seales had ratifi’d it."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9aa1eab-2b08-4316-9e40-979f32b6c72b",
                                "sense_id": "a8a41b03-22c7-33ea-9842-5354d9f8cd2f",
                                "text": "[H]e proteſted to me, that if he vvas naked in Bed vvith me, he vvould as ſacredly preſerve my Virtue, as he vvould defend it if I vvas aſſaulted by a Raviſher; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f72e4d64-d064-45b8-9f2c-36101d47fcdf",
                                "sense_id": "a8a41b03-22c7-33ea-9842-5354d9f8cd2f",
                                "text": "[…] I have a communication of a very private—indeed, I will say, of a sacredly confidential nature, which I desire to make to you."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ac0e3140-2309-49b0-8cbb-e08c8f3dab13",
                                "sense_id": "a8a41b03-22c7-33ea-9842-5354d9f8cd2f",
                                "text": "Each girl has to read her story out loud and then we talk it over. We are going to keep them all sacredly and have them to read to our descendants […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "71cc0855-2fea-47d4-b006-c48ae0d91cc4",
                                "sense_id": "a8a41b03-22c7-33ea-9842-5354d9f8cd2f",
                                "text": "Satisfaction because the ritual of Gormenghast was proceeding as sacredly and deliberately as ever before […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
